<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Workspace Optimisation</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fafafa;
            color: #171717;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-4 md:p-8">

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="border-b border-zinc-200 pb-6 text-center md:text-left">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Procreate Fertility</p>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-zinc-900">Workspace Optimisation</h1>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-2 text-lg">Data-driven answers to your core questions and the financial impact of optimisation.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- The 5 Core Questions -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Q1 -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="credit-card" class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-400"></i> 1. What am I paying for?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
                    You are paying <strong>$2,027/month</strong> for 60 seats of Google's highest tier (Enterprise Plus) at ~$42/seat, plus 2 AI Expanded Access add-ons. You are paying a premium for 5TB storage per user, advanced data regions, Enterprise endpoint management, and Google Vault.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Q2 -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="bar-chart-2" class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-400"></i> 2. Are my users using it?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>No.</strong> 12 of your 60 seats are completely dormant. Your heaviest user only consumes 69 GB (3% of the 5TB limit). Crucially, Google Vault is completely unconfigured and dormant, meaning you've been paying for a compliance feature you aren't using.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Q3 -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="arrow-down-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-400"></i> 3. Can I downgrade?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Yes.</strong> You can immediately remove the 12 dormant seats and convert dead shared inboxes to free Google Groups. You can then drop the remaining 48 active users down to the <strong>Business Standard</strong> tier.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Q4 -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="activity" class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-400"></i> 4. Will this break workflows?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>No.</strong> Because your clinical Patient Health Information (PHI) lives in your EHR system, Gmail/Drive are just coordination tools. You do not need Google Vault for HIPAA retention. 2TB of storage is more than enough for your heaviest user.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Q5 / Requirements -->
            <div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm md:col-span-2 text-white">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="check-square" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400"></i> 5. Meeting Your Specific Requirements
                </h3>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-zinc-800 p-4 rounded-lg">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 mb-1"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4"></i> <span class="font-semibold text-sm">HIPAA Compliant</span></div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Yes. Sign the BAA in Admin Console (covers all tiers).</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-zinc-800 p-4 rounded-lg">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 mb-1"><i data-lucide="pen-tool" class="w-4 h-4"></i> <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Digital Signature</span></div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Yes. Included in Business Standard automatically.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-zinc-800 p-4 rounded-lg">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 mb-1"><i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-4 h-4"></i> <span class="font-semibold text-sm">AI for 2 Users</span></div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Yes. The AI add-on transfers seamlessly to the new plan.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-zinc-800 p-4 rounded-lg">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 mb-1"><i data-lucide="mail-check" class="w-4 h-4"></i> <span class="font-semibold text-sm">5 Encrypted Emails</span></div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Yes. Layer a 3rd-party HIPAA gateway (Paubox/Virtru) over the 5 accounts.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- The Impact (Now vs Then) -->
        <div class="mt-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-zinc-900">The Financial Impact: Now vs. Optimized</h2>
            
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                
                <!-- NOW -->
                <div class="bg-zinc-50 p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-zinc-200">
                    <div class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Current State</div>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6">$2,027 <span class="text-lg font-normal text-zinc-500">/ mo</span></div>
                    
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-zinc-600">
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
                            <span><strong>60</strong> Enterprise Plus Seats (@ ~$42)</span>
                            <span>$2,520*</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
                            <span><strong>2</strong> AI Expanded Access</span>
                            <span>$36</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
                            <span class="text-red-500">Waste: 12 Dormant Seats</span>
                            <span class="text-red-500">-$504 value</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
                            <span class="text-red-500">Waste: Unused Vault & 5TB</span>
                            <span class="text-red-500">Paying Premium</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-4">*Invoice reflects mid-month prorations lowering the gross total</p>
                </div>

                <!-- OPTIMIZED -->
                <div class="bg-emerald-50 p-8 relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg">
                        RECOMMENDED
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Optimized Build</div>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mb-6">$858 <span class="text-lg font-normal text-emerald-700">/ mo</span></div>
                    
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-emerald-900">
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-emerald-200">
                            <span><strong>48</strong> Business Standard Seats (@ $14)</span>
                            <span>$672</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-emerald-200">
                            <span><strong>2</strong> AI Expanded Access</span>
                            <span>$36</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-emerald-200">
                            <span><strong>5</strong> HIPAA Gateway Licenses (Est.)</span>
                            <span>~$150</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-emerald-200">
                            <span class="font-semibold">Waste Eliminated</span>
                            <span class="font-semibold">$0</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="mt-6 bg-white/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-800">Total Annual Savings</span>
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-600">~$14,028 (58%)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Execution Caveats -->
        <div class="mt-6 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Important Execution Assumptions
            </h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-amber-800 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                <li><strong>Contract Renewal Lock-in:</strong> While dormant seats can usually be removed immediately, Google may prevent downgrading the remaining seats from <em>Enterprise Plus</em> to <em>Business Standard</em> until your annual contract renewal date. Check Admin Console &rarr; Billing to verify your date.</li>
                <li><strong>HIPAA Gateway Pricing:</strong> The $150/month cost is a standard industry estimate (~$30/user/month for tools like Paubox or Virtru). You must secure a direct quote to finalize this line item.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>